An HDR entry in Advanced Video Options, where the game hides its own: a list of None, Soft, ACES
and AgX that sets r_HDRRendering and d3d12_ToneMap, the tone map of the HDR pipeline of
XRenderD3D12 (greyed out with another renderer). Patch Scripts.cmd applies it to
FCData/Scripts.pak.

